{
  "info": {
    "name": "13 \u00b7 Async exports",
    "description": "The async CSV export pipeline \u2014 template catalog, job lifecycle (queue \u2192 worker \u2192 download), idempotency, and RBAC.\n\n**Flow.** A) `GET /exports` template catalog (auth-only, no-token 401); B) `POST /exports/jobs` \u2192 **202**, then **poll** `GET /exports/jobs/{id}` until `status == ready`, `GET .../download` the `text/csv`, and confirm it appears in the scoped jobs list; C) idempotency \u2014 a same-key/same-body retry returns the **same** job, a same-key/different-template retry is **409**; D) RBAC \u2014 a non-admin lacking the template's permission is 403 \u2014 then delete the job (204) and confirm 404.\n\n**\u26a0 Requires the worker.** Jobs are processed by a Celery **worker** \u2014 bring the stack up with `make up` (worker included). If jobs sit in `pending` forever, the worker is down/stale (see the `exports-stale-env` runbook note).\n\n**Async poll.** Step B2 re-sends itself via `postman.setNextRequest` until `ready`; set a ~1s **delay** in the Collection Runner so the worker keeps up.\n\n**Contract gotchas.** Create + list both need **exactly one** of `evaluation_id` / `evaluation_group_id` (400 otherwise); `idempotency_key` must be a UUID; the terminal success status is `ready` (not `completed`).\n\n**Auth model.** Per-request: `{{admin_token}}` for the lifecycle, `{{viewer_token}}` for the 403, `noauth` for the 401. Self-contained \u2014 no `00-bootstrap`, no manual token.\n\n**Leftovers.** The source evaluation group leaks (no group DELETE; `run_suffix` keeps it unique); the job is deleted in folder D.\n\n**Verified green on a live stack** (`make up` + `make seedlocal`): every assertion passes, with **zero failures** on repeated runs. Deliberately no fixed `N/N` here \u2014 folder B re-sends its poll via `setNextRequest` until the worker marks the job `ready`, so each extra poll contributes its own assertions and the total moves run to run (28\u201329 observed). A pinned count would be wrong by construction; the invariant worth recording is **failed = 0**.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "noauth"
  },
